<title>HUNGARY: Hungary June PPI up 0.8 pct m/m - preliminary.</title>
<headline>Hungary June PPI up 0.8 pct m/m - preliminary.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's producer price index in June was 0.8 percent up month-on-month and 19.4 percent year-on-year, according to preliminary figures released by the Central Statistical Office on Monday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY PRODUCER PRICE INDEX</p>
<p>					 June 1997  May 1997  June 1996</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.8     +0.7	+0.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    +19.4    +19.1     +21.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The final, detailed index will be released on August 13.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
